{"id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-formal-system.md","title":"Formal System","display":"df-formal-system — Formal System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-formal-system","aliases":["92-df-formal-system"],"display":"df-formal-system — Formal System","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-formal-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-formal-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formal-system — Formal System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-formal-system-—-Formal-System-$\\mathcal{F}$\">df-formal-system — Formal System <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (candidate set-theoretic triple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是形式系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> : 符号表/签名</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> : 公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 有限前提序列到结论的推理规则关系</li>\n<li>Smullyan将形式系统定义为三元组(符号表,公理,推理规则)</li>\n<li>这是最基础的概念，无前置依赖</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-formal-system-—-Formal-System-$\\mathcal{F}$","text":"df-formal-system — Formal System $\\mathcal{F}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^{<\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{<\\omega}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":993,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]] - 形式系统"},{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"